# SPDX-License-Identifier: CC-BY-SA-4.0
game: Bulk Slash (Japan)
gameid: T-14310G
system: saturn
---

# Mission number 1-7, 8 during a boss fight and its clear screen, 0 in the menu.
watch state byte 0x06022081

# Menu selected mission 0-6.
watch selected byte 0x06022513

def ingame state > 0

# Death flag: 0 while alive, set to 1 the frame health falls below
# zero, cleared back to 0 by the respawn init. It sits at offset 242
# of the player entity, and each mission's overlay places that entity
# at its own address.
watch deaths1 word 0x0605CAE2
watch deaths2 word 0x0605B7A2
watch deaths3 word 0x0605F272
watch deaths4 word 0x0605F3A2
watch deaths5 word 0x0605E552
watch deaths6 word 0x06060B92
watch deaths7 word 0x06061522

on deaths1 increased to 1 while ingame and selected == 0: pulse 1.0 600ms priority 1
on deaths2 increased to 1 while ingame and selected == 1: pulse 1.0 600ms priority 1
on deaths3 increased to 1 while ingame and selected == 2: pulse 1.0 600ms priority 1
on deaths4 increased to 1 while ingame and selected == 3: pulse 1.0 600ms priority 1
on deaths5 increased to 1 while ingame and selected == 4: pulse 1.0 600ms priority 1
on deaths6 increased to 1 while ingame and selected == 5: pulse 1.0 600ms priority 1
on deaths7 increased to 1 while ingame and selected == 6: pulse 1.0 600ms priority 1

# Player health.
watch health word 0x060235D0

on health decreased while ingame: pulse 0.85 300ms
